法"],"proposal_text":"研究程序按筛选期、治疗期和随访期三个阶段组织。筛选期用于确认受试者是否符合入选与排除标准，包括人口学信息采集、病史采集、体格检查、生命体征测量、心电图、实验室检查（含NT-proBNP基线检测）、LVEF评估及NYHA心功能分级确认。治疗期持续12周，受试者每日晨起口服KZ-sGC2301 25mg或50mg或匹配安慰剂一次，按2:1:1比例随机分配。治疗期间安全性监测涵盖TEAE发生率与严重程度、生命体征、心电图及实验室检查异常，重点关注症状性低血压事件。主要疗效评估为第12周NT-proBNP较基线变化百分比，由中心实验室统一检测。随访期用于收集治疗结束后安全性数据及不良事件转归。各访视的具体日期、评估项目组合及时间窗由访视日程表规定。","rationale":"研究分期（筛选-治疗-随访）、治疗期12周、每日一次晨服、2:1:1随机、双盲、主要终点NT-proBNP第12周变化、安全性终点（TEAE/生命体征/ECG/实验室/症状性低血压）均来自已确认研究事实。但筛选期具体天数、各访视日编号及对应评估项目、NT-proBNP除基线和第12周外是否还有其他采集时点、随访期时长、依从性评价方式、计划外访视触发条件等实施细节未在来源中给出。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_c2b4f6b36cfa_ed9eb73413f1089a","section_number":"7.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:eaf46b00a6d065d24c24538b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"e3795742a3b27caed3e0ff0696433a5650dacaf6120dcb1a357296afdc01ca53","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_c2b4f6b36cfa_d32f1403e36f9644:full-draft:eaf46b00a6d065d24c24538b","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:eaf46b00a6d065d24c24538b","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:7229634723277c379be3a99d4611fda439d7e6ff2650264fc5bc232e6c02c8ce:eaf46b00a6d065d24c24538b","text_sha256":"e3795742a3b27caed3e0ff0696433a5650dacaf6120dcb1a357296afdc01ca53"},{"content_sha256":"db6e25d19d6b2cdb6cd0e334c08e2c596588bee9fea02a764494dd819a5dc6b4","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:revision:5","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_56b96348f0f97cd896c4:r5:3b8925778cb6ff75","text_sha256":"db6e25d19d6b2cdb6cd0e334c08e2c596588bee9fea02a764494dd819a5dc6b4"}]}